.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104865.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Added warnings when the previous and new value of a shader parameter are incompatible.\r\nE.g. calling `set_shader_parameter(\"param\", 2)` with an `int` when it was previously a `Vector3`, will warn:\r\n`Type mismatch between previous and new value: Vector3 and int`\r\n\r\nAlso added a warning when passing in an object that isn't a valid texture. Maybe this should produce an error instead?\r\n\r\nIf performance is a concern, these checks could be made for just debug builds.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104865/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104865/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}